1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:19,853
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,696
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:34,075
[Julio] <i>Lily Cruz…</i>

15
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:36,202
<i>We meet again.</i>

16
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:38,788
<i>I will make you suffer</i>

17
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:41,833
<i>like I am suffering right now.</i>

18
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,627
<i>If Red Dragon's daughter</i>
<i>really is ferocious,</i>

19
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:46,796
<i>then we are unstoppable together.</i>

20
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,090
<i>My mama taught me very well.</i>

21
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:50,049
[Julio] <i>Emilia.</i>

22
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:53,386
<i>Get your big behind up here.</i>

23
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:54,721
<i>Yes.</i>

24
00:00:54,804 --> 00:00:56,765
<i>We have her again.</i>

25
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:59,851
<i>The indestructible</i>

26
00:00:59,934 --> 00:01:01,561
<i>Lily Cruz.</i>

27
00:01:01,644 --> 00:01:03,897
[Lily] <i>I won't let these butchers win.</i>

28
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:07,150
<i>As long as I'm alive, I'll always</i>
<i>have an ace up my sleeve.</i>

29
00:01:07,233 --> 00:01:09,152
<i>I will not go down without a fight.</i>

30
00:01:09,235 --> 00:01:10,695
<i>Jepoy, it's time.</i>

31
00:01:10,779 --> 00:01:13,198
<i>We must execute Lily's plans now.</i>

32
00:01:13,281 --> 00:01:17,118
<i>What we need is strong evidence</i>
<i>of the Ardientes' heinous crimes.</i>

33
00:01:17,202 --> 00:01:20,246
<i>I saw skeletons in the woods</i>
<i>of San Bartolome.</i>

34
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,332
<i>Exposing the Ardientes' dastardly deeds</i>
<i>may be the only way to save Lily.</i>

35
00:01:22,415 --> 00:01:23,458
[man] <i>Listen up, everyone!</i>

36
00:01:23,541 --> 00:01:26,294
<i>The governor wants us</i>
<i>to head over to the plaza.</i>

37
00:01:26,377 --> 00:01:28,379
<i>He said they will bring</i>
<i>Lily Cruz there and punish her</i>

38
00:01:28,463 --> 00:01:30,298
<i>for murdering our mayor!</i>

39
00:01:30,381 --> 00:01:34,886
[crowd chanting]
<i>Viva, Ardiente! Viva, Ardiente!</i>

40
00:01:34,969 --> 00:01:38,807
[Julio] <i>Behold the cancer</i>
<i>afflicting this town.</i>

41
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:41,059
<i>-Lily Cruz!</i>
-[crowd jeering]

42
00:01:41,142 --> 00:01:43,520
<i>-She killed the mayor!</i>
<i>-You murderer!</i>

43
00:01:43,603 --> 00:01:45,271
<i>You deserve to be punished!</i>

44
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:46,731
<i>Marlon! Jepoy!</i>

45
00:01:48,608 --> 00:01:51,361
[Edna] <i>What if Mom and Dad</i>
<i>are down there, Ronald?</i>

46
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:52,737
<i>Mom?</i>

47
00:01:52,821 --> 00:01:53,863
[Camia] <i>Lily!</i>

48
00:01:53,947 --> 00:01:55,824
<i>You monsters! Let her go!</i>

49
00:01:56,366 --> 00:01:57,951
[Emilia] <i>We are going for a walk.</i>

50
00:01:58,034 --> 00:02:00,870
<i>I'm going to escort you to hell!</i>

51
00:02:01,412 --> 00:02:02,956
<i>We're going to call this</i>

52
00:02:03,039 --> 00:02:05,333
<i>"The March of Sinners."</i>

53
00:02:05,416 --> 00:02:07,168
[Lily] <i>To save Diego</i>

54
00:02:07,252 --> 00:02:10,380
<i>and to light the hope that</i>
<i>the people's suffering will end,</i>

55
00:02:10,463 --> 00:02:11,881
<i>I will do it.</i>

56
00:02:11,965 --> 00:02:16,803
[crowd jeering]

57
00:02:19,931 --> 00:02:22,392
-[heavy breathing]
-[chilling music playing]

58
00:02:22,475 --> 00:02:23,726
[Ronald sobs]

59
00:02:23,810 --> 00:02:25,145
[Edna] Ma? Pa?

60
00:02:26,354 --> 00:02:28,439
Where are my mother and father?!

61
00:02:28,523 --> 00:02:29,941
Where are they?!

62
00:02:30,817 --> 00:02:32,819
[chilling music playing]

63
00:02:33,486 --> 00:02:35,822
[Ronald] How will we find
our parents here?!

64
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:37,407
Tell me!

65
00:02:37,490 --> 00:02:39,033
I know they've been dead for years.

66
00:02:39,117 --> 00:02:41,077
But to simply dump their bodies here?

67
00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:42,745
They're monsters.

68
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:45,874
They desecrated our parents.

69
00:02:45,957 --> 00:02:47,667
[breath quivers]

70
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,669
[Edna] They didn't even stop to think

71
00:02:49,752 --> 00:02:53,798
that these people they killed

72
00:02:53,882 --> 00:02:59,137
have a father, a mother,
a child, a sibling…

73
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:02,724
They have no regard
for human life, Ronald!

74
00:03:02,807 --> 00:03:05,059
-Edna… [cries]
-[Edna whimpers]

75
00:03:05,143 --> 00:03:07,812
[screams] The Ardientes are monsters!

76
00:03:07,896 --> 00:03:09,522
-Monsters!
-[crying]

77
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:12,525
[Edna] What did they do to our parents?!

78
00:03:12,609 --> 00:03:16,029
[hoarse screams] This isn't my child!

79
00:03:16,112 --> 00:03:17,947
It's not!

80
00:03:18,031 --> 00:03:22,285
[stuttering] This can't be my child!

81
00:03:22,368 --> 00:03:24,621
[sobbing, wheezing]

82
00:03:24,704 --> 00:03:28,166
[woman wailing]

83
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:30,960
[chilling music playing]

84
00:03:31,044 --> 00:03:32,295
Friends, Mister Fernan,

85
00:03:32,754 --> 00:03:34,047
gather all the residents of Ardiente.

86
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:35,840
Even the Ardiente loyalists.

87
00:03:35,924 --> 00:03:38,676
Call the press so the whole world can see

88
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,220
the ruthlessness of the Ardientes.

89
00:03:40,386 --> 00:03:41,512
-All right.
-Let's go.

90
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:42,472
Come on. Hurry.

91
00:03:42,555 --> 00:03:43,431
Let's go.

92
00:03:44,432 --> 00:03:51,105
[dramatic music playing]

93
00:04:04,285 --> 00:04:10,250
-[foreboding music playing]
-[indistinct chatter]

94
00:04:11,334 --> 00:04:12,168
Colonel.

95
00:04:12,418 --> 00:04:13,211
Sir.

96
00:04:13,962 --> 00:04:16,756
I am sure Diego Torillo…

97
00:04:17,548 --> 00:04:19,217
will rescue his wife.

98
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:25,265
Now, it is a very stupid move on his part.

99
00:04:26,516 --> 00:04:28,768
But I know he has no choice.

100
00:04:29,727 --> 00:04:31,479
He'll be forced to come here.

101
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:37,068
I want you to tell all your men

102
00:04:37,151 --> 00:04:40,363
that the moment they see Diego Torillo…

103
00:04:41,447 --> 00:04:44,701
I want them to shoot him down

104
00:04:44,784 --> 00:04:46,995
and bring his body to me.

105
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:48,705
Yes, sir.

106
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:51,249
All four walls. All four
walls on this channel.

107
00:04:51,332 --> 00:04:53,126
Standing order from the Governor:

108
00:04:53,209 --> 00:04:55,670
when the primary Tango arrives,
shoot to kill.

109
00:04:55,753 --> 00:04:57,964
I repeat, shoot to kill. Confirm.

110
00:04:58,756 --> 00:05:01,968
[in Spanish] Blood will
be paid with blood.

111
00:05:04,012 --> 00:05:06,889
Blood will be paid…

112
00:05:06,973 --> 00:05:08,599
with blood.

113
00:05:08,683 --> 00:05:15,690
[ominous music playing]

114
00:05:17,859 --> 00:05:19,152
-[whip cracking]
-[Lily groaning]

115
00:05:19,944 --> 00:05:21,404
-[whip cracking]
-[Lily grunts]

116
00:05:21,487 --> 00:05:23,573
-You witch!
-Hit her!

117
00:05:23,656 --> 00:05:25,283
-Scum!
-Murderer!

118
00:05:26,576 --> 00:05:27,327
[whip cracking]

119
00:05:27,410 --> 00:05:29,537
-[Emilia] You want some more?!
-[Camia crying]

120
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,955
-Kill her!
-Murderer!

121
00:05:31,039 --> 00:05:32,832
-Lily!
-Viva Ardiente!

122
00:05:32,915 --> 00:05:34,500
I AM A MURDERER
I KILLED YOUR MAYOR

123
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:35,835
[whip cracking]

124
00:05:35,918 --> 00:05:38,629
-[crowd jeering]
-Oh, Lily…

125
00:05:38,713 --> 00:05:40,798
Let go! Don't touch me!

126
00:05:41,507 --> 00:05:42,800
-[Emilia] What?!
-[whip cracking]

127
00:05:42,884 --> 00:05:44,635
Lily!

128
00:05:44,719 --> 00:05:51,726
[crowd continues jeering]

129
00:05:51,809 --> 00:05:53,352
[Emilia] Want more?!

130
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:55,104
-Kill her!
-Move!

131
00:05:55,188 --> 00:05:57,273
-Miss Camia!
-[Camia crying]

132
00:05:57,356 --> 00:06:01,402
-Miss Camia, please help Lily!
-Let us through!

133
00:06:01,486 --> 00:06:03,780
-Let us through, sir!
-Miss Camia, help…

134
00:06:03,863 --> 00:06:06,240
-Please, sir! Let us through!
-[Camia wailing] Lily!

135
00:06:06,324 --> 00:06:09,535
-[crowd continues jeering]
-[dramatic music playing]

136
00:06:10,036 --> 00:06:11,204
[man] She's a scum!

137
00:06:13,956 --> 00:06:15,833
[man] That's what she deserves!

138
00:06:18,377 --> 00:06:19,420
Lily…

139
00:06:19,504 --> 00:06:21,839
[wailing] Please, have mercy. Stop it.

140
00:06:21,923 --> 00:06:26,219
Stop hurting Lily!
She doesn't deserve this!

141
00:06:26,302 --> 00:06:27,970
-Scum! Keep walking!
-Get up!

142
00:06:28,054 --> 00:06:31,349
[crowd continues jeering]

143
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:38,856
[dramatic music playing]

144
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:40,775
Enough!

145
00:06:44,445 --> 00:06:46,614
[Lily] <i>If this is where it all ends,</i>

146
00:06:47,365 --> 00:06:49,075
<i>there are only two things I'll ask for.</i>

147
00:06:51,702 --> 00:06:54,539
<i>I want my husband, Diego, to live,</i>

148
00:06:55,790 --> 00:06:58,042
<i>and for my mother to always be safe,</i>

149
00:06:58,126 --> 00:07:00,545
<i>so they can continue the fight…</i>

150
00:07:03,381 --> 00:07:05,091
<i>And that someday,</i>

151
00:07:05,883 --> 00:07:08,469
<i>this town will finally be free</i>
<i>of the Ardientes.</i>

152
00:07:11,055 --> 00:07:12,598
<i>Forgive me…</i>

153
00:07:15,017 --> 00:07:18,938
<i>for lighting the fire</i>
<i>I should've extinguished myself.</i>

154
00:07:21,023 --> 00:07:27,488
[melancholic music playing]

155
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:32,618
[crowd jeering]

156
00:07:32,702 --> 00:07:34,245
-Get up!
-Kill her!

157
00:07:34,328 --> 00:07:35,538
-Get up!
-Punish her!

158
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:38,708
-[Camia crying]
-Stop torturing her!

159
00:07:38,791 --> 00:07:41,711
-She deserves it!
-Don't kill her, please!

160
00:07:41,794 --> 00:07:46,716
[crowd continues jeering]

161
00:07:47,216 --> 00:07:49,510
My daughter!

162
00:07:50,928 --> 00:07:53,598
-Kill her!
-She's a scum!

163
00:07:53,681 --> 00:07:57,268
[crowd cheers]

164
00:07:57,351 --> 00:08:03,232
[somber music playing]

165
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:15,495
[music fades]

166
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:28,508
[unsettling music playing]

167
00:08:51,447 --> 00:08:58,871
[unsettling music playing]

168
00:09:15,179 --> 00:09:22,728
[unsettling music intensifies]

169
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:36,450
[chilling music playing]

170
00:09:43,749 --> 00:09:46,377
[Lily] <i>If my life ends here,</i>

171
00:09:47,461 --> 00:09:50,673
<i>please help me until my last breath</i>

172
00:09:50,756 --> 00:09:53,384
<i>because I'm not leaving this town</i>

173
00:09:53,467 --> 00:09:55,428
<i>without putting up a fight.</i>

174
00:09:58,097 --> 00:10:05,396
[chilling music continues playing]

175
00:10:08,774 --> 00:10:12,403
[wailing]

176
00:10:12,486 --> 00:10:13,863
[man] Don't come any closer.

177
00:10:23,998 --> 00:10:25,333
Lily…

178
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:29,670
-Nanny?
-Lily…

179
00:10:31,088 --> 00:10:32,632
[voice shaking] Lily?

180
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:35,426
[Lily] Nanny Carlotta…

181
00:10:35,718 --> 00:10:37,720
[dramatic music playing]

182
00:10:38,846 --> 00:10:42,725
[sobbing]

183
00:10:42,808 --> 00:10:44,518
[Lily] It hurts so much.

184
00:10:45,019 --> 00:10:46,771
Lily, you can do this.

185
00:10:48,939 --> 00:10:51,317
I don't know if I can. [breath hitches]

186
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,362
I'm too weak, Nanny. [gasps]

187
00:10:55,029 --> 00:10:57,698
I'm too weak to fight. [wheezes]

188
00:10:57,782 --> 00:11:00,159
[crying]

189
00:11:00,242 --> 00:11:02,411
-Nanny… [whimpers]
-Lily… [shushes]

190
00:11:02,495 --> 00:11:03,996
Get up, Lily.

191
00:11:04,622 --> 00:11:07,083
-[Lily shivering]
-Get up, my dear.

192
00:11:07,875 --> 00:11:09,585
Shh.

193
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:11,796
-I can't, Nanny.
-Shh!

194
00:11:13,005 --> 00:11:16,217
Keep fighting, dear. You can do it.

195
00:11:16,717 --> 00:11:18,761
You can do it.

196
00:11:19,261 --> 00:11:26,310
[dramatic music playing]

197
00:11:33,943 --> 00:11:35,027
Dad?

198
00:11:40,491 --> 00:11:43,244
Take me with you, Dad.

199
00:11:44,245 --> 00:11:45,955
I'm giving up.

200
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:48,249
I give up.

201
00:11:50,209 --> 00:11:51,377
No, Lily.

202
00:11:52,336 --> 00:11:53,379
Keep fighting.

203
00:11:53,462 --> 00:11:57,216
[crying]

204
00:11:57,299 --> 00:11:58,717
Don't give up.

205
00:11:59,593 --> 00:12:02,555
But it hurts so much, Dad.

206
00:12:03,472 --> 00:12:05,182
[Lily sobs]

207
00:12:09,186 --> 00:12:14,942
[dramatic music playing]

208
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:17,862
So, you want more, huh?!

209
00:12:18,737 --> 00:12:20,197
Please stop hurting her!

210
00:12:20,281 --> 00:12:22,658
[wailing] Have mercy!

211
00:12:23,451 --> 00:12:24,910
[crowd jeering]

212
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:28,497
[somber music playing]

213
00:12:32,793 --> 00:12:33,961
[camera shutter clicking]

214
00:12:34,753 --> 00:12:37,756
[man] I can't believe they left
your mother's body here.

215
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,091
[camera shutter clicking]

216
00:12:46,682 --> 00:12:48,434
This is my mom's rosary…

217
00:12:49,685 --> 00:12:51,395
They're worse than animals!

218
00:12:51,479 --> 00:12:54,064
Those Ardientes are worse than animals!

219
00:12:54,148 --> 00:12:57,401
They're monsters!
Wretched monsters! [sobs]

220
00:12:58,110 --> 00:12:59,278
Curse them!

221
00:13:00,654 --> 00:13:02,698
[sobbing]

222
00:13:02,781 --> 00:13:04,658
Now that we have proof

223
00:13:04,742 --> 00:13:06,952
of the Ardiente family's crimes,

224
00:13:07,036 --> 00:13:09,747
it's time for us to rise up against them

225
00:13:09,830 --> 00:13:12,500
so that no citizen of Poblacion Ardiente

226
00:13:12,583 --> 00:13:15,461
will ever suffer the same horrible fate

227
00:13:15,544 --> 00:13:20,007
as our parents, siblings, and children.

228
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:21,342
Now is the time

229
00:13:21,425 --> 00:13:22,968
for change!

230
00:13:24,637 --> 00:13:27,765
Justice for our families!

231
00:13:27,848 --> 00:13:30,893
And justice for the victims
of the Ardientes!

232
00:13:30,976 --> 00:13:33,103
It's time for retribution!

233
00:13:33,729 --> 00:13:35,314
Down with the Ardientes!

234
00:13:35,397 --> 00:13:42,863
[people chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

235
00:13:43,489 --> 00:13:48,494
[people chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

236
00:13:48,869 --> 00:13:52,665
[people chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

237
00:13:52,748 --> 00:13:53,666
[camera shutter clicks]

238
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:08,722
I heard they dump

239
00:14:08,806 --> 00:14:11,141
anyone who goes
against the Ardientes there.

240
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:12,935
But no one's been able to confirm it,

241
00:14:13,018 --> 00:14:15,479
and that's why they can still claim

242
00:14:15,563 --> 00:14:17,648
that this town is crime-free.

243
00:14:17,731 --> 00:14:20,609
This means Lily's been telling the truth.

244
00:14:20,693 --> 00:14:22,736
That the Ardientes really did kidnap

245
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:24,446
their families and kill them.

246
00:14:24,822 --> 00:14:25,990
Lily Cruz was right!

247
00:14:26,073 --> 00:14:27,783
She's been fighting for justice.

248
00:14:27,867 --> 00:14:29,201
You're all right.

249
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,912
And if we don't take action now,

250
00:14:31,996 --> 00:14:34,957
Lily Cruz will end up dead
like those corpses.

251
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,960
And it could happen to you, me…

252
00:14:38,043 --> 00:14:39,336
and everyone else.

253
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:40,963
So, we have to act now.

254
00:14:41,046 --> 00:14:42,756
[woman] Right!
Let's fight for what's right.

255
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,633
Let's expose the truth.

256
00:14:47,261 --> 00:14:52,391
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

257
00:14:52,558 --> 00:14:55,895
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

258
00:14:55,978 --> 00:14:58,230
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

259
00:15:00,858 --> 00:15:03,819
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

260
00:15:03,903 --> 00:15:05,654
Down with the Ardientes!

261
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:06,947
Down!

262
00:15:07,031 --> 00:15:13,412
[chanting continues]
Down with the Ardientes!

263
00:15:14,246 --> 00:15:18,292
Emilia Ardiente-Torillo took over
Red Dragon's organization

264
00:15:18,834 --> 00:15:20,628
while her mother was in hiding.

265
00:15:21,837 --> 00:15:22,922
[Helena] <i>And while I'm away,</i>

266
00:15:23,005 --> 00:15:26,425
<i>I am entrusting my position</i>
<i>to my baby girl.</i>

267
00:15:26,508 --> 00:15:29,803
<i>My baby dragon, Emilia Ardiente-Torillo.</i>

268
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,808
I'm ready to expose
all the crimes she committed.

269
00:15:35,976 --> 00:15:38,687
<i>I was ordered to bomb</i>
<i>Lily Cruz's building.</i>

270
00:15:39,813 --> 00:15:41,357
<i>Where's the bomb?!</i>

271
00:15:42,399 --> 00:15:46,528
-[bomb timer beeping]
-[tense music playing]

272
00:15:48,572 --> 00:15:51,116
I was the chairman of the council

273
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,159
in the previous elections.

274
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:55,120
-[sighs] I accepted bribes…
-[camera shutter clicks]

275
00:15:55,204 --> 00:15:58,874
…from Julio Ardiente
to rig the election results

276
00:15:58,958 --> 00:16:02,628
so he could be elected as
governor of Poblacion Ardiente.

277
00:16:03,087 --> 00:16:06,090
[Julio]<i> Here's your fifty million pesos.</i>

278
00:16:06,173 --> 00:16:09,259
<i>And there's an additional ten million</i>

279
00:16:09,969 --> 00:16:12,513
<i>for helping me win this election.</i>

280
00:16:14,056 --> 00:16:16,183
I regret everything I've done.

281
00:16:16,850 --> 00:16:18,727
The true winner of that election…

282
00:16:19,395 --> 00:16:20,938
was Diego Torillo.

283
00:16:21,855 --> 00:16:23,983
He is the true governor…

284
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:25,526
of Poblacion Ardiente.

285
00:16:26,235 --> 00:16:28,737
We have intelligence reports
that will prove

286
00:16:29,363 --> 00:16:32,533
that the Ardientes took over
Red Dragon's syndicate.

287
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,576
I was once

288
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:37,121
Emilia Ardiente's henchman.

289
00:16:38,914 --> 00:16:40,749
It was Emilia Ardiente…

290
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:45,546
who had Dante Cruz poisoned and killed.

291
00:16:45,629 --> 00:16:48,007
-[tires screeching]
-[loud crash]

292
00:16:48,090 --> 00:16:51,176
I went insane when I realized

293
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:54,596
I was the one who gave
the poison that killed him.

294
00:16:55,764 --> 00:16:57,933
My conscience has been eating me up.

295
00:16:59,435 --> 00:17:01,145
Out of jealousy,

296
00:17:01,228 --> 00:17:03,689
Emilia Ardiente ordered me,

297
00:17:03,772 --> 00:17:07,985
<i>to rape, kill, and bury Camia Cruz.</i>

298
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:11,238
<i>Because Raul, Emilia's husband</i>
<i>was in love with Camia.</i>

299
00:17:12,197 --> 00:17:14,491
Lily Cruz hid me abroad.

300
00:17:15,325 --> 00:17:17,327
She protected me

301
00:17:17,411 --> 00:17:20,622
so I could come here
and tell the whole world

302
00:17:20,706 --> 00:17:22,708
about the Ardientes' evil deeds.

303
00:17:23,667 --> 00:17:25,461
Let's all help Lily Cruz.

304
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:29,048
Let's all give her family justice!

305
00:17:33,427 --> 00:17:36,305
Attorney, how's your case
against the Ardientes?

306
00:17:36,388 --> 00:17:38,682
The provincial prosecution
has found sufficient grounds

307
00:17:38,766 --> 00:17:40,893
to pursue the case against the Ardientes.

308
00:17:40,976 --> 00:17:43,312
This case is definitely moving forward.

309
00:17:43,395 --> 00:17:45,898
What charges will they be pressed with?

310
00:17:45,981 --> 00:17:47,524
Multiple counts of murder.

311
00:17:48,317 --> 00:17:49,735
Frustrated murder,

312
00:17:49,818 --> 00:17:51,236
election fraud, among many others.

313
00:17:54,615 --> 00:17:55,949
I too was a victim

314
00:17:56,033 --> 00:17:58,702
of that wretched Ardiente family.

315
00:18:01,955 --> 00:18:04,041
They killed my father.

316
00:18:04,124 --> 00:18:06,418
[suspenseful music playing]

317
00:18:06,502 --> 00:18:08,879
[camera shutter clicking]

318
00:18:10,047 --> 00:18:12,049
-[gunshot]
-<i>Ah!</i>

319
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:18,388
Enough is enough.

320
00:18:19,389 --> 00:18:21,600
It is game over

321
00:18:21,683 --> 00:18:23,977
for the governor and his wicked daughter.

322
00:18:27,689 --> 00:18:31,193
Because I have joined
Ms. Lily Cruz's fight.

323
00:18:32,778 --> 00:18:34,321
Justice will be served.

324
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:38,659
And I will make sure…

325
00:18:38,742 --> 00:18:40,953
that it hits them hard.

326
00:18:44,248 --> 00:18:51,255
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

327
00:18:52,005 --> 00:18:58,887
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

328
00:18:59,263 --> 00:19:04,977
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

329
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:07,479
Down! Down!

330
00:19:07,563 --> 00:19:10,482
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down!

331
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:13,360
Move!

332
00:19:13,443 --> 00:19:15,279
-She deserves to die!
-Hang her!

333
00:19:15,362 --> 00:19:16,905
-Hang that murderer!
-Kill Lily!

334
00:19:16,989 --> 00:19:19,074
[crowd jeering]

335
00:19:19,158 --> 00:19:21,577
[hoarse screams] Stop this!

336
00:19:21,660 --> 00:19:25,372
[crowd continues jeering]

337
00:19:25,455 --> 00:19:28,750
This woman just won't die, will she?

338
00:19:28,834 --> 00:19:30,544
-Hang her!
-Kill her!

339
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,838
After this, hang her.

340
00:19:33,922 --> 00:19:36,300
I know. I don't wanna say it, Papa, but…

341
00:19:36,383 --> 00:19:38,093
your wish is always my command.

342
00:19:38,177 --> 00:19:40,220
-You deserve to die!
-Go to hell!

343
00:19:40,304 --> 00:19:42,598
-You killed the mayor!
-Die, Lily!

344
00:19:42,681 --> 00:19:43,682
[Emilia claps]

345
00:19:43,765 --> 00:19:45,225
Come on, Lily.

346
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:49,188
It's your time to die now.

347
00:19:49,771 --> 00:19:51,982
-Die!
-[crowd] Kill her!

348
00:19:52,566 --> 00:19:54,401
-Hang her!
-She's a murderer!

349
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:56,778
[Camila wailing]

350
00:19:56,862 --> 00:19:59,114
[Camia] You monsters! You're all monsters!

351
00:19:59,198 --> 00:20:01,617
-Kill her!
-Just stop this!

352
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,910
Please!

353
00:20:02,993 --> 00:20:05,329
[woman] She killed the mayor. Kill her!

354
00:20:05,412 --> 00:20:07,956
[man] She's a scum! She deserves to die!

355
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:13,003
-[crowd jeering]
-[Camia crying]

356
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:15,464
-[Camia] Stop!
-Right! Hang her!

357
00:20:15,547 --> 00:20:18,008
-Yeah, kill her!
-That's what she deserves!

358
00:20:18,091 --> 00:20:20,093
-Hang her!
-Die, Lily!

359
00:20:20,177 --> 00:20:22,471
-Lily… [crying]
-Kill her!

360
00:20:22,554 --> 00:20:23,889
[people chanting] Kill Lily!

361
00:20:23,972 --> 00:20:25,891
[Julio] Citizens of Ardiente!

362
00:20:25,974 --> 00:20:29,311
I present to you Mayor Arnaldo's killer…

363
00:20:29,394 --> 00:20:31,813
-[crowd jeering]
-…Lily Cruz!

364
00:20:31,897 --> 00:20:33,774
-Murderer!
-Scum!

365
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:35,442
Please, no…

366
00:20:35,525 --> 00:20:37,236
-She's scum!
-Hang her now!

367
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:38,737
-Execute her!
-Die, murderer!

368
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:40,239
-Hang her!
-You witch!

369
00:20:40,322 --> 00:20:42,658
-[crowd jeering]
-[Camia wailing]

370
00:20:42,741 --> 00:20:43,700
[Camia] Stop!

371
00:20:43,784 --> 00:20:45,035
Execute her.

372
00:20:45,118 --> 00:20:47,537
-[Emilia clapping]
-[crowd jeering]

373
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:48,830
Down!

374
00:20:48,914 --> 00:20:50,123
-Kill her!
-Down!

375
00:20:50,207 --> 00:20:51,959
[crowd jeering]

376
00:20:54,461 --> 00:20:55,629
Ready?

377
00:20:56,171 --> 00:20:57,923
-Take her down!
-Kill her!

378
00:20:58,006 --> 00:20:59,675
-Murderer!
-Hang her!

379
00:20:59,758 --> 00:21:01,969
-Lily, my dear…
-[crowd jeering]

380
00:21:02,052 --> 00:21:03,428
-Die!
-Kill her now!

381
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:07,933
[crowd jeering]

382
00:21:08,016 --> 00:21:12,020
[crowd chanting] Kill her!

383
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:15,899
Thank you for gathering
the townspeople today!

384
00:21:17,276 --> 00:21:18,193
Papa…

385
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:20,779
Now they can see…

386
00:21:20,862 --> 00:21:23,490
just how tainted your souls really are!

387
00:21:23,573 --> 00:21:24,825
[camera shutter clicking]

388
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:27,953
-Diego?
-[man] What?

389
00:21:28,036 --> 00:21:34,501
[suspenseful music playing]

390
00:21:36,712 --> 00:21:39,923
Who are you to talk like that, huh?

391
00:21:40,382 --> 00:21:42,092
Don't believe them!

392
00:21:42,175 --> 00:21:43,468
[Diego] We have proof!

393
00:21:43,552 --> 00:21:44,803
[Edna] Watch this!

394
00:21:45,637 --> 00:21:49,599
We've found the corpses of our loved ones!

395
00:21:49,683 --> 00:21:51,768
And they were killed by the Ardientes!

396
00:21:52,602 --> 00:21:54,396
What they're saying is true!

397
00:21:54,479 --> 00:21:56,732
We were loyal followers
of the Ardientes too,

398
00:21:56,815 --> 00:22:00,319
until we saw the mass grave ourselves!

399
00:22:00,986 --> 00:22:04,781
Witnesses against the Ardientes
have also testified!

400
00:22:05,282 --> 00:22:06,908
[Marlon] The murderous family you idolize

401
00:22:06,992 --> 00:22:09,369
has been exposed to the whole world.

402
00:22:09,453 --> 00:22:12,247
[Fernan] You're the only ones
who remain blind to the truth!

403
00:22:13,081 --> 00:22:18,295
[slow tense music playing]

404
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:21,882
[camera shutter clicking]

405
00:22:23,842 --> 00:22:24,843
[camera shutter clicking]

406
00:22:26,887 --> 00:22:30,724
<i>-Down with the Ardientes!</i>
<i>-Down!</i>

407
00:22:30,807 --> 00:22:32,350
-<i>Down with--</i>
-[Anna] <i>Diego?</i>

408
00:22:32,434 --> 00:22:33,268
[Marlon] <i>Diego…</i>

409
00:22:33,351 --> 00:22:37,439
<i>Everyone, help me save my wife</i>
<i>from the Ardientes!</i>

410
00:22:37,522 --> 00:22:40,358
<i>Let's go to the plaza and save Lily!</i>

411
00:22:40,442 --> 00:22:41,234
<i>Diego.</i>

412
00:22:41,318 --> 00:22:43,487
<i>The place is heavily guarded</i>
<i>by the Ardientes' men.</i>

413
00:22:43,570 --> 00:22:44,654
<i>I have a plan.</i>

414
00:22:44,738 --> 00:22:46,698
[Diego] <i>We'll storm the plaza.</i>

415
00:22:47,032 --> 00:22:49,117
<i>We'll use the loyalists they gathered</i>

416
00:22:49,201 --> 00:22:51,286
<i>as shields against them.</i>

417
00:22:51,369 --> 00:22:53,914
<i>We can't face them head-on.</i>

418
00:22:53,997 --> 00:22:55,957
<i>But we'll infiltrate the plaza…</i>

419
00:22:56,041 --> 00:22:58,752
-<i>using these signs and shirts.</i>
-THANK YOU, ARDIENTE.

420
00:22:58,835 --> 00:23:00,837
<i>We'll pose as their allies.</i>

421
00:23:00,921 --> 00:23:02,881
<i>And we'll save Lily Cruz.</i>

422
00:23:02,964 --> 00:23:05,592
[Diego] <i>Our only weapon is the truth.</i>

423
00:23:05,675 --> 00:23:06,593
<i>Jepoy.</i>

424
00:23:06,676 --> 00:23:07,719
<i>We're ready.</i>

425
00:23:08,220 --> 00:23:10,305
<i>We're ready to infiltrate the plaza.</i>

426
00:23:15,602 --> 00:23:18,605
-Is this true?!
-We believed in you!

427
00:23:18,688 --> 00:23:20,148
You fooled us!

428
00:23:20,232 --> 00:23:21,441
You liars!

429
00:23:21,525 --> 00:23:23,026
Silence, all of you!

430
00:23:23,110 --> 00:23:25,612
Don't believe their lies!

431
00:23:25,695 --> 00:23:27,614
They're the criminals!

432
00:23:27,697 --> 00:23:30,575
They're the ones
wreaking havoc in our town!

433
00:23:31,076 --> 00:23:32,577
[Diego] You're the criminals!

434
00:23:32,661 --> 00:23:33,912
You murderers!

435
00:23:33,995 --> 00:23:36,331
-Murderers!
-Bring them down!

436
00:23:36,414 --> 00:23:38,667
[crowd jeering]

437
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:39,918
Papa…

438
00:23:40,001 --> 00:23:41,128
-You monsters!
-Murderers!

439
00:23:41,211 --> 00:23:42,963
As expected…

440
00:23:43,046 --> 00:23:44,548
you're all idiots!

441
00:23:45,048 --> 00:23:46,842
You should listen to me!

442
00:23:46,925 --> 00:23:48,718
You should follow me!

443
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:51,471
I'm the King of Ardiente!

444
00:23:52,139 --> 00:23:53,265
What?

445
00:23:53,348 --> 00:23:54,432
Cat got your tongues?

446
00:23:54,516 --> 00:23:55,892
Do you want money?

447
00:23:55,976 --> 00:23:56,977
Fine!

448
00:23:57,978 --> 00:23:59,771
Here's your money! Happy now?

449
00:23:59,855 --> 00:24:00,897
Well?

450
00:24:00,981 --> 00:24:02,023
Have some more!

451
00:24:04,484 --> 00:24:06,153
Viva Ardiente!

452
00:24:06,236 --> 00:24:08,029
-Viva Ardiente!
-Viva Ardiente!

453
00:24:08,113 --> 00:24:09,948
Viva, Ardiente!

454
00:24:10,031 --> 00:24:13,368
[tense music playing]

455
00:24:13,451 --> 00:24:15,328
Down with the Ardientes!

456
00:24:15,412 --> 00:24:17,289
-Down!
-Down with the Ardientes!

457
00:24:17,372 --> 00:24:18,206
Down!

458
00:24:18,290 --> 00:24:25,130
[crowd chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

459
00:24:25,213 --> 00:24:32,429
[crowd keeps chanting]
Down with the Ardientes!

460
00:24:32,512 --> 00:24:39,978
Down with the Ardientes!
Down with the Ardientes!

461
00:24:40,061 --> 00:24:43,607
Down! Down with the Ardientes!

462
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:46,151
-Magbanua, do something!
-Julio Ardiente, Emilia Torillo!

463
00:24:46,234 --> 00:24:47,152
[crowd] Down!

464
00:24:47,235 --> 00:24:50,155
Surrender now! We have you surrounded!

465
00:24:51,198 --> 00:24:53,825
[tense music playing]

466
00:24:56,161 --> 00:24:58,330
Don't listen to them!
Arrest them! Arrest them--

467
00:24:58,413 --> 00:24:59,915
-[gunshots]
-[shrieks]

468
00:25:01,249 --> 00:25:03,001
-[gunshots]
-[man] Hold your fire! Hold your fire!

469
00:25:03,835 --> 00:25:06,755
[gunshots]

470
00:25:06,838 --> 00:25:07,631
[Col. Magbanua] Go!

471
00:25:07,714 --> 00:25:09,090
Hold your fire!

472
00:25:09,174 --> 00:25:13,345
-[gunshots]
-[crowd clamoring]

473
00:25:17,265 --> 00:25:19,559
Finally! Serves the Ardientes right!

474
00:25:25,273 --> 00:25:26,483
[Camia] <i>Diego!</i>

475
00:25:26,566 --> 00:25:28,276
<i>-Get down!</i>
<i>-You!</i>

476
00:25:28,360 --> 00:25:33,573
-[gunshots]
-[people clamoring]

477
00:25:36,284 --> 00:25:37,202
You…

478
00:25:38,286 --> 00:25:39,371
[Emilia] Do something!

479
00:25:39,454 --> 00:25:41,998
This is all your fault!

480
00:25:42,749 --> 00:25:44,709
You ruined my family.

481
00:25:44,793 --> 00:25:47,170
You ruined Ardiente.

482
00:25:47,254 --> 00:25:48,505
This is your fault!

483
00:25:49,172 --> 00:25:51,508
[loud thud]

484
00:25:51,591 --> 00:25:54,719
[indistinct screaming]

485
00:25:56,054 --> 00:25:58,014
Diego, save Lily!

486
00:25:59,557 --> 00:26:00,517
Lily!

487
00:26:03,228 --> 00:26:04,145
Lily!

488
00:26:04,229 --> 00:26:05,897
Papa, let's go!

489
00:26:05,981 --> 00:26:06,982
Lily!

490
00:26:07,065 --> 00:26:08,233
Lily, my dear!

491
00:26:08,316 --> 00:26:09,359
Papa, let's go!

492
00:26:09,442 --> 00:26:11,987
Don't let the Ardientes get away!

493
00:26:12,070 --> 00:26:13,863
-[crowd clamoring]
-Marlon!

494
00:26:13,947 --> 00:26:15,782
[grunts, groans]

495
00:26:15,865 --> 00:26:17,284
-Marlon!
-Lily!

496
00:26:17,367 --> 00:26:18,576
Hurry!

497
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:19,828
Save her, please…

498
00:26:23,290 --> 00:26:24,374
Hurry, please!

499
00:26:25,583 --> 00:26:27,877
-Put her down!
-Make way!

500
00:26:27,961 --> 00:26:29,129
-Boss!
-Get back!

501
00:26:29,212 --> 00:26:30,922
-Out of the way!
-Get back!

502
00:26:31,548 --> 00:26:32,841
-Slowly now.
-Lily…

503
00:26:32,924 --> 00:26:33,800
Move! Move!

504
00:26:36,594 --> 00:26:39,848
Papa, why did the people turn on us?

505
00:26:39,931 --> 00:26:42,309
-What went wrong? Tell me!
-[faint shouting]

506
00:26:42,392 --> 00:26:44,144
-My God, they're here!
-[loud tapping on windows]

507
00:26:44,227 --> 00:26:47,355
There's no one to blame but Lily Cruz!

508
00:26:47,439 --> 00:26:49,357
-[loud tapping, shouting]
-We should move!

509
00:26:49,441 --> 00:26:51,026
Get us out of here!

510
00:26:51,109 --> 00:26:56,156
-[loud tapping on windows]
-[indistinct shouting]

511
00:26:56,948 --> 00:26:59,909
[Camia sobbing]

512
00:26:59,993 --> 00:27:01,244
Lily…

513
00:27:01,578 --> 00:27:03,538
-Untie her.
-Hold on. Wait. Wait.

514
00:27:03,621 --> 00:27:05,582
-Careful on her head.
-[Camia sobbing]

515
00:27:06,958 --> 00:27:09,961
-[keys clanking]
-[tense music playing]

516
00:27:10,837 --> 00:27:12,255
[panting]

517
00:27:12,339 --> 00:27:13,423
Lily?

518
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:16,968
-Lily?
-Lily…

519
00:27:19,471 --> 00:27:21,556
[panicked breathing]

520
00:27:21,639 --> 00:27:22,766
Lily…

521
00:27:22,849 --> 00:27:24,184
My dear…

522
00:27:24,267 --> 00:27:25,727
[Camia sobbing]

523
00:27:27,145 --> 00:27:33,693
[somber music playing]

524
00:27:44,704 --> 00:27:52,462
[somber music continues playing]

525
00:27:55,632 --> 00:27:57,008
-Lily!
-Wake up!

526
00:27:57,092 --> 00:27:58,468
Lily, please!

527
00:28:01,429 --> 00:28:09,145
[somber music playing]

528
00:28:14,109 --> 00:28:16,027
<i>-Get up, dear.</i>
<i>-Keep fighting.</i>

529
00:28:16,111 --> 00:28:17,529
<i>You can do it, dear.</i>

530
00:28:17,612 --> 00:28:19,114
<i>Don't give up.</i>

531
00:28:23,451 --> 00:28:24,828
-Lily?
-[Lily coughs]

532
00:28:24,911 --> 00:28:26,246
-Lily?
-Oh, my dear…

533
00:28:26,329 --> 00:28:27,747
-Lily?
-Lily!

534
00:28:27,831 --> 00:28:29,874
-Lily!
-Long live the new Ardiente!

535
00:28:29,958 --> 00:28:30,708
Lily?!

536
00:28:30,792 --> 00:28:35,755
-Long live the new Ardiente!
-Long live!

537
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:40,844
-[crowd chanting] Long live!
-[sobbing]

538
00:28:41,469 --> 00:28:47,809
[cheering and applause]

539
00:28:47,892 --> 00:28:49,853
Long live the new Ardiente!

540
00:28:49,936 --> 00:28:50,854
-Long live!
-Long live!

541
00:28:50,937 --> 00:28:52,856
Long live the new Ardiente!

542
00:28:52,939 --> 00:28:54,023
-Long live!
-Long live!

543
00:28:54,107 --> 00:28:56,401
Long live the new Poblacion Ardiente!

544
00:28:56,484 --> 00:28:57,652
-Long live!
-Long live!

545
00:28:57,736 --> 00:28:59,904
Long live the new Poblacion Ardiente!

546
00:28:59,988 --> 00:29:01,823
[cheering and applause]

547
00:29:01,906 --> 00:29:02,949
-Long live!
-Long live!

548
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:14,627
[crowd cheering, applauding]

549
00:29:19,257 --> 00:29:25,305
[somber music playing]

550
00:29:29,017 --> 00:29:35,857
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

551
00:29:36,232 --> 00:29:43,031
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

552
00:29:43,615 --> 00:29:49,120
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

553
00:29:49,412 --> 00:29:52,916
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

554
00:29:55,168 --> 00:30:00,673
[dramatic music playing]

555
00:30:10,975 --> 00:30:13,686
[metal clanking]

556
00:30:14,979 --> 00:30:16,397
-Pull!
-Go!

557
00:30:16,481 --> 00:30:18,858
-[crowd cheering]
-[echoing thud]

558
00:30:19,776 --> 00:30:21,778
[crowd cheering, applauding]

559
00:30:22,195 --> 00:30:29,953
[dramatic music playing]

560
00:30:33,373 --> 00:30:34,541
[man] Let's celebrate!

561
00:30:34,624 --> 00:30:41,381
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

562
00:30:41,756 --> 00:30:49,347
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

563
00:30:49,931 --> 00:30:54,936
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

564
00:30:55,186 --> 00:30:58,356
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

565
00:30:58,690 --> 00:31:01,234
[dramatic music playing]

566
00:31:01,568 --> 00:31:06,739
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

567
00:31:07,156 --> 00:31:13,371
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

568
00:31:13,705 --> 00:31:19,961
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

569
00:31:20,461 --> 00:31:25,425
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

570
00:31:25,758 --> 00:31:32,515
[crowd chanting] New Poblacion Ardiente!

571
00:31:36,436 --> 00:31:39,188
[car honking]

572
00:31:41,232 --> 00:31:44,319
[tense music playing]

573
00:31:59,792 --> 00:32:01,377
-Assist my father.
-[Julio grunting]

574
00:32:03,171 --> 00:32:04,005
[Julio groans]

575
00:32:08,301 --> 00:32:12,430
[tense music playing]

576
00:32:13,640 --> 00:32:15,475
This town…

577
00:32:15,558 --> 00:32:18,686
was made with the flesh
and blood of my ancestors.

578
00:32:19,896 --> 00:32:21,689
Those pathetic ingrates!

579
00:32:22,023 --> 00:32:23,983
They'll have to kill me first

580
00:32:24,067 --> 00:32:26,778
before they kick me out of here!

581
00:32:27,028 --> 00:32:28,571
-Emilia…
-What?

582
00:32:28,655 --> 00:32:31,699
Order a news blackout right away.

583
00:32:32,325 --> 00:32:34,535
No outsider must know

584
00:32:34,619 --> 00:32:36,496
about what happened here today.

585
00:32:37,914 --> 00:32:39,123
[Julio] Come on!

586
00:32:40,083 --> 00:32:42,502
Men, stand your ground.

587
00:32:42,585 --> 00:32:44,087
Don't let anyone in.

588
00:32:48,007 --> 00:32:49,926
[applauding]

589
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:52,553
-[high-pitched ringing]
-Huh?

590
00:32:52,637 --> 00:32:54,055
-What happened?
-Is it broken?

591
00:32:54,138 --> 00:32:56,557
Melchor, check the antenna.

592
00:32:57,475 --> 00:32:59,394
[Melchor] The TV's working just fine.

593
00:33:01,771 --> 00:33:04,315
I bet this is all Ardiente's doing.

594
00:33:04,399 --> 00:33:05,650
Those crooks!

595
00:33:05,733 --> 00:33:08,152
So, all this time, we've been
supporting liars!

596
00:33:08,236 --> 00:33:09,153
I know.

597
00:33:09,237 --> 00:33:11,406
The Ardientes are murderers.

598
00:33:11,489 --> 00:33:12,865
They're all criminals!

599
00:33:13,157 --> 00:33:15,076
[high-pitched ringing]

600
00:33:15,159 --> 00:33:16,244
There they go again.

601
00:33:16,327 --> 00:33:18,329
Those Ardientes
are stirring up trouble again!

602
00:33:18,413 --> 00:33:20,915
They keep playing us for fools!

603
00:33:20,999 --> 00:33:22,041
You're right!

604
00:33:23,710 --> 00:33:25,086
[phone chimes]

605
00:33:27,588 --> 00:33:29,382
Mom, I got a text message.

606
00:33:29,465 --> 00:33:30,675
Everyone!

607
00:33:30,758 --> 00:33:32,844
Let's pass on Lily Cruz's
message to the others!

608
00:33:32,927 --> 00:33:35,430
The fate of this town is in our hands.

609
00:33:35,722 --> 00:33:37,974
The witnesses against
the Ardientes have come forward.

610
00:33:38,057 --> 00:33:40,226
The secret mass grave has been found.

611
00:33:40,309 --> 00:33:42,645
It's time that the world
learned the truth!

612
00:33:42,729 --> 00:33:43,896
-That's right!
-Yeah!

613
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:45,690
-Those monsters!
-They lied to us!

614
00:33:46,232 --> 00:33:48,609
-Come on! Let's go!
-Let's go!

615
00:33:48,693 --> 00:33:49,777
[phone chimes]

616
00:33:50,903 --> 00:33:53,322
TOGETHER, LET'S DRIVE
THE ARDIENTES OUT OF THIS TOWN!

617
00:33:53,406 --> 00:33:54,532
Here's a text message.

618
00:33:54,615 --> 00:33:57,076
"Together, let's drive
the Ardientes out of this town!"

619
00:33:57,160 --> 00:33:58,411
-Come on!
-Let's go!

620
00:33:59,579 --> 00:34:00,705
[phone chimes]

621
00:34:00,788 --> 00:34:02,248
TOGETHER, LET'S DRIVE
THE ARDIENTES OUT OF THIS TOWN!

622
00:34:02,331 --> 00:34:03,291
[utensils clanking]

623
00:34:03,374 --> 00:34:04,167
Come on!

624
00:34:04,250 --> 00:34:06,544
Let's get rid of those
Ardientes and restore power

625
00:34:06,627 --> 00:34:08,463
to the townspeople!

626
00:34:08,546 --> 00:34:10,256
-Let's go!
-Come on!

627
00:34:11,507 --> 00:34:15,428
[phones chime]

628
00:34:17,263 --> 00:34:19,766
As you can see, a news blackout
has been declared

629
00:34:19,849 --> 00:34:21,267
in Poblacion Ardiente

630
00:34:21,350 --> 00:34:23,561
where the townspeople have gathered

631
00:34:23,644 --> 00:34:25,730
to overthrow the Ardientes.

632
00:34:25,813 --> 00:34:27,899
I'm doing this because
it's my responsibility

633
00:34:27,982 --> 00:34:29,358
to let the world know

634
00:34:29,442 --> 00:34:32,195
about the real situation
in Poblacion Ardiente.

635
00:34:32,278 --> 00:34:33,696
Please don't bash me.

636
00:34:34,363 --> 00:34:37,075
[suspenseful music playing]

637
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:38,284
Papa!

638
00:34:38,367 --> 00:34:40,328
Papa, the whole town's coming for us!

639
00:34:40,411 --> 00:34:41,871
[Emilia panting]

640
00:34:41,954 --> 00:34:43,873
Hey! Where are you going?!

641
00:34:43,956 --> 00:34:45,792
I'm packing my things, Papa!

642
00:34:45,875 --> 00:34:48,461
We are not leaving this house!

643
00:34:49,253 --> 00:34:52,882
[foreboding music playing]

644
00:34:52,965 --> 00:34:54,008
Magbanua.

645
00:34:54,842 --> 00:34:57,386
Secure the perimeter.

646
00:34:57,470 --> 00:34:59,931
I don't want any intruders in this house.

647
00:35:03,392 --> 00:35:05,937
Governor, I'm sorry to say this, but

648
00:35:06,604 --> 00:35:07,814
we've lost many of our men.

649
00:35:07,897 --> 00:35:10,024
Most have surrendered, and many are hurt.

650
00:35:10,733 --> 00:35:12,527
I don't give a damn!

651
00:35:13,653 --> 00:35:17,240
Use your bodies as shields if you must.

652
00:35:17,865 --> 00:35:20,660
No one comes into my fortress.

653
00:35:21,202 --> 00:35:22,703
Because this house

654
00:35:22,787 --> 00:35:23,996
is unsinkable.

655
00:35:24,789 --> 00:35:27,583
I am unsinkable!

656
00:35:28,543 --> 00:35:33,047
[tense music playing]

657
00:35:35,508 --> 00:35:36,676
Yes, sir.

658
00:35:49,438 --> 00:35:50,940
-What's the situation?
-Colonel.

659
00:35:51,023 --> 00:35:53,276
Hundreds of people
are heading for the mansion.

660
00:35:53,359 --> 00:35:54,735
They're coming to finish us.

661
00:35:55,903 --> 00:35:57,905
We only have one order from the governor,

662
00:35:57,989 --> 00:36:01,075
and that's to protect the mansion
so no one gets inside.

663
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:02,535
He has forsaken us.

664
00:36:02,618 --> 00:36:04,495
He doesn't care what happens to us.

665
00:36:04,579 --> 00:36:05,746
We're soldiers.

666
00:36:05,830 --> 00:36:07,999
We're trained to obey, not to question.

667
00:36:08,082 --> 00:36:09,584
Colonel Magbanua,

668
00:36:09,667 --> 00:36:11,627
we've been loyal to you.

669
00:36:11,711 --> 00:36:14,005
But think about us.

670
00:36:14,088 --> 00:36:15,089
We have children.

671
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:22,597
[crowd clamoring]

672
00:36:23,556 --> 00:36:25,474
Mayday! Mayday! I need backup!

673
00:36:25,558 --> 00:36:27,643
It's getting out of control here!

674
00:36:27,727 --> 00:36:29,270
-Hey! Do you copy?!
-[crowd clamoring]

675
00:36:29,645 --> 00:36:30,897
-I need backup!
-[crowd clamoring]

676
00:36:30,980 --> 00:36:33,232
The people are forcing their way in--

677
00:36:33,316 --> 00:36:35,818
-[shouting in the distance]
-Men…

678
00:36:35,902 --> 00:36:37,361
Lock and load.

679
00:36:37,445 --> 00:36:39,947
[faint shouting in the distance]

680
00:36:40,031 --> 00:36:41,157
Positions.

681
00:36:41,240 --> 00:36:42,033
Prepare.

682
00:36:42,116 --> 00:36:44,410
[crowd chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

683
00:36:44,493 --> 00:36:47,747
[crowd clamoring]

684
00:36:56,631 --> 00:36:59,258
[crowd clamoring]

685
00:37:02,220 --> 00:37:03,346
Men, hold your positions.

686
00:37:03,429 --> 00:37:04,430
Hold!

687
00:37:04,513 --> 00:37:07,016
[suspenseful music playing]

688
00:37:07,433 --> 00:37:09,393
[soldier] Colonel, what are
we going to do?

689
00:37:09,477 --> 00:37:10,853
We can't take them all down.

690
00:37:11,312 --> 00:37:16,400
I don't think we even
have enough bullets, Colonel!

691
00:37:17,610 --> 00:37:18,778
Hold your ground.

692
00:37:18,861 --> 00:37:20,238
Hold your fire.

693
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:22,198
Hold your fire!

694
00:37:22,990 --> 00:37:24,951
Prepare for maximum tolerance!

695
00:37:25,493 --> 00:37:28,162
-Down with the Ardientes!
-You betrayed us all!

696
00:37:28,246 --> 00:37:29,789
Colonel Magbanua!

697
00:37:31,165 --> 00:37:33,251
Make sure not a single one
of them gets into my house!

698
00:37:34,210 --> 00:37:36,921
Shoot anyone who dares enter!

699
00:37:37,004 --> 00:37:38,089
Kill them all!

700
00:37:38,506 --> 00:37:41,342
Shoot us all you want!
It just proves you're a demon!

701
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:44,303
May your conscience eat you alive!

702
00:37:44,387 --> 00:37:47,056
-Go on and shoot us!
-Murderer!

703
00:37:47,974 --> 00:37:49,225
Kill them!

704
00:37:49,517 --> 00:37:51,435
The nerve of these peasants

705
00:37:51,894 --> 00:37:53,854
to come here and storm my mansion!

706
00:37:54,689 --> 00:37:55,648
How dare you?!

707
00:37:55,731 --> 00:37:57,024
Colonel!

708
00:37:57,108 --> 00:37:59,235
You have a sworn duty…

709
00:37:59,318 --> 00:38:00,569
to protect me!

710
00:38:00,903 --> 00:38:02,738
Protect me! Shoot them!

711
00:38:02,822 --> 00:38:03,864
Kill them!

712
00:38:03,948 --> 00:38:05,825
-Don't kill us!
-Please, have mercy!

713
00:38:05,908 --> 00:38:08,661
-Spare us!
-Have mercy!

714
00:38:08,744 --> 00:38:13,082
[indistinct cries]

715
00:38:13,666 --> 00:38:14,625
Don't kill us!

716
00:38:14,709 --> 00:38:16,210
[man] Have mercy on us!

717
00:38:16,294 --> 00:38:20,673
[indistinct cries]

718
00:38:20,756 --> 00:38:21,882
Magbanua!

719
00:38:21,966 --> 00:38:25,594
[indistinct crying, yelling]

720
00:38:25,678 --> 00:38:26,846
Why aren't you shooting?!

721
00:38:26,929 --> 00:38:28,681
-Please, don't!
-Don't kill us!

722
00:38:28,764 --> 00:38:31,267
Hold… hold your fire!

723
00:38:31,350 --> 00:38:32,393
-Magbanua!
-Hold!

724
00:38:32,476 --> 00:38:34,895
What the hell are you waiting for?!

725
00:38:34,979 --> 00:38:36,564
-Shoot them!
-Hold!

726
00:38:36,647 --> 00:38:38,274
[man] Go ahead! Shoot us!

727
00:38:38,357 --> 00:38:40,359
-Kill them!
-So the whole world will know…

728
00:38:40,443 --> 00:38:42,361
-Men!
-…how evil you are!

729
00:38:43,529 --> 00:38:45,531
Stand down! Stand down!

730
00:38:45,614 --> 00:38:46,866
Men, stand down!

731
00:38:46,949 --> 00:38:48,242
-Governor…
-Colonel!

732
00:38:48,784 --> 00:38:50,328
-Get inside.
-Thank you, Colonel.

733
00:38:50,411 --> 00:38:51,996
Please!

734
00:38:53,456 --> 00:38:54,623
You fool.

735
00:38:54,707 --> 00:38:56,083
Stand down, men.

736
00:38:56,959 --> 00:38:59,253
[tense music playing]

737
00:39:00,546 --> 00:39:05,509
-[camera shutters clicking]
-[crying]

738
00:39:06,635 --> 00:39:08,846
You filthy little peasants!

739
00:39:08,929 --> 00:39:10,723
You're all worthless!

740
00:39:11,349 --> 00:39:14,352
Is this how you thank your Father Julio?

741
00:39:15,561 --> 00:39:17,688
I'm the one who kept you alive!

742
00:39:17,772 --> 00:39:19,023
If it weren't for me,

743
00:39:19,106 --> 00:39:21,734
you'd have starved to death!

744
00:39:22,318 --> 00:39:24,153
Get out of my sight!

745
00:39:25,404 --> 00:39:27,656
As for the rest of you, Magbanua,

746
00:39:27,740 --> 00:39:31,035
you're nothing but cowards!

747
00:39:32,703 --> 00:39:35,456
Now, get out of my house!

748
00:39:36,499 --> 00:39:37,708
[loud thud]

749
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,835
[tense music playing]

750
00:39:40,211 --> 00:39:41,170
[camera shutters clicking]

751
00:39:41,253 --> 00:39:44,799
[locks clicking]

752
00:39:46,425 --> 00:39:48,552
There's no way they'll catch me alive.

753
00:39:49,303 --> 00:39:56,560
[crowd chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

754
00:40:02,441 --> 00:40:10,116
[dramatic music playing]

755
00:40:22,294 --> 00:40:29,093
[dramatic music continues playing]

756
00:40:45,359 --> 00:40:52,783
[tense music playing]

757
00:41:08,716 --> 00:41:15,723
[tense music continues playing]

758
00:41:18,017 --> 00:41:23,022
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

759
00:41:27,943 --> 00:41:30,654
-[people clamoring]
-[camera shutters clicking]

760
00:41:35,034 --> 00:41:41,624
[slow tense music playing]

761
00:41:51,675 --> 00:41:52,718
[woman 1] Come on!

762
00:41:52,801 --> 00:41:55,387
-Let's find those Ardientes!
-Where are those criminals?

763
00:41:55,471 --> 00:41:57,348
-These thieves.
-Wow. This is so beautiful.

764
00:41:57,723 --> 00:41:59,350
-It's beautiful.
-It's so grand. Incredible!

765
00:41:59,433 --> 00:42:00,768
-My goodness!
-These are beautiful.

766
00:42:00,851 --> 00:42:02,770
[woman 1] These are from
the public's money.

767
00:42:03,187 --> 00:42:03,938
[woman 2] Wow!

768
00:42:04,021 --> 00:42:06,982
Look at all this jewelry!

769
00:42:07,399 --> 00:42:09,902
These are expensive.
They'll look good on me.

770
00:42:09,985 --> 00:42:12,029
-Wow! Incredible!
-Take everything!

771
00:42:12,112 --> 00:42:14,323
-What are you doing?!
-Emilia!

772
00:42:14,406 --> 00:42:15,991
-Put that down!
-Wretched Ardiente!

773
00:42:16,075 --> 00:42:17,201
-Those are mine!
-You thief!

774
00:42:17,284 --> 00:42:19,578
These don't belong to you!

775
00:42:19,662 --> 00:42:22,039
-These are from public funds!
-You're all thieves!

776
00:42:22,122 --> 00:42:24,625
-Give them back!
-You're the thief!

777
00:42:24,708 --> 00:42:26,043
We're taking them back!

778
00:42:26,126 --> 00:42:28,754
-How dare you?!
-How dare you steal my things?!

779
00:42:28,837 --> 00:42:31,799
Hey! You and your family
are the thieves here!

780
00:42:31,882 --> 00:42:33,217
-That's right!
-Move!

781
00:42:33,300 --> 00:42:34,552
-How dare you!
-That's mine!

782
00:42:35,010 --> 00:42:36,136
Give me that!

783
00:42:36,220 --> 00:42:38,514
This is the public's money!

784
00:42:38,597 --> 00:42:41,350
Thief! You want it?
Shove it down your throat!

785
00:42:41,433 --> 00:42:43,644
Have some more! You people are shameless!

786
00:42:43,727 --> 00:42:44,812
[Emilia] You thieves!

787
00:42:44,895 --> 00:42:46,397
-You crook!
-You're the thief!

788
00:42:47,189 --> 00:42:53,529
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

789
00:42:54,905 --> 00:42:56,365
[Julio] Pigs!

790
00:42:56,448 --> 00:42:58,200
Pathetic ingrates!

791
00:42:58,284 --> 00:43:04,290
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

792
00:43:11,171 --> 00:43:15,217
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

793
00:43:15,301 --> 00:43:17,344
You want a piece of me, huh?!

794
00:43:17,428 --> 00:43:19,763
-[people yelling, shouting]
-Low-lying…

795
00:43:19,847 --> 00:43:22,433
blood-sucking parasites.
That's all you are!

796
00:43:22,516 --> 00:43:25,019
-[people clamoring]
-Papa, thank God!

797
00:43:25,102 --> 00:43:26,312
Enough, Papa!

798
00:43:26,395 --> 00:43:28,314
Enough! We have to go!

799
00:43:28,397 --> 00:43:30,858
The whole house is surrounded!

800
00:43:30,941 --> 00:43:32,318
Let them come in!

801
00:43:32,401 --> 00:43:36,280
So they can all suffer
the wrath of their Father Julio!

802
00:43:36,363 --> 00:43:38,240
I'll kill them all!

803
00:43:38,324 --> 00:43:39,533
No, Papa!

804
00:43:39,617 --> 00:43:42,036
You're going to die here! I'm leaving!

805
00:43:42,661 --> 00:43:43,996
[Julio] Come on!

806
00:43:48,334 --> 00:43:50,419
I'm here! Come on!

807
00:43:50,502 --> 00:43:52,171
Papa, let's go, please?!

808
00:43:52,254 --> 00:43:53,255
Let's go!

809
00:43:53,339 --> 00:43:56,258
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

810
00:43:56,342 --> 00:43:57,134
Ingrates!

811
00:43:57,217 --> 00:43:59,303
Enough! Papa, let's go!

812
00:43:59,386 --> 00:44:03,849
-[loud tapping on window]
-[people clamoring]

813
00:44:03,932 --> 00:44:05,893
Papa, let's go! Come on!

814
00:44:05,976 --> 00:44:07,686
[people yelling, shouting]

815
00:44:07,770 --> 00:44:09,355
[Emilia] Papa, they're coming inside!

816
00:44:09,438 --> 00:44:11,357
Papa! Let's go!

817
00:44:11,440 --> 00:44:16,320
-Down with the Ardientes!
-Down! Down!

818
00:44:16,403 --> 00:44:21,700
-[people clamoring]
-[tense music playing]

819
00:44:22,993 --> 00:44:25,412
All this came from the taxpayers' money!

820
00:44:26,538 --> 00:44:28,874
These are from taxpayers' money!
Take all of them!

821
00:44:29,833 --> 00:44:33,045
-[glass breaking]
-[objects clattering]

822
00:44:33,128 --> 00:44:34,338
-Take them all!
-Go!

823
00:44:34,880 --> 00:44:36,215
They stole this from us!

824
00:44:36,298 --> 00:44:38,467
Take everything!
We're taking back what's ours!

825
00:44:38,550 --> 00:44:39,468
Take it all!

826
00:44:39,551 --> 00:44:40,803
-This is mine!
-Hey!

827
00:44:40,886 --> 00:44:42,262
[woman] That's from taxpayers' money!

828
00:44:42,346 --> 00:44:44,264
Those Ardientes are thieves!

829
00:44:44,348 --> 00:44:46,266
-This one's mine!
-Those monsters!

830
00:44:46,975 --> 00:44:48,185
Stop it!

831
00:44:48,268 --> 00:44:50,187
[indistinct shouting]

832
00:44:50,270 --> 00:44:51,647
[Emilia] They're taking my picture, Papa!

833
00:44:51,730 --> 00:44:54,733
It's over! Let's go, Papa!

834
00:44:54,817 --> 00:44:56,693
[Julio] Don't touch my daughter's picture!

835
00:44:56,777 --> 00:44:58,695
-Leave that picture alone!
-[loud thud]

836
00:44:58,779 --> 00:45:01,532
[Emilia] Pa, they ruined
everything. It's over!

837
00:45:01,615 --> 00:45:02,991
It's over!

838
00:45:04,034 --> 00:45:05,911
Julio Ardiente, you monster!

839
00:45:05,994 --> 00:45:07,538
-[loud smashing]
-[people yelling]

840
00:45:07,621 --> 00:45:09,373
-[Julio] Bastards!
-[Emilia crying]

841
00:45:11,125 --> 00:45:14,002
-[loud smashing, crashing]
-[indistinct shouting]

842
00:45:15,754 --> 00:45:16,755
You bastards!

843
00:45:16,839 --> 00:45:19,508
-[gunshots]
-[Emilia screaming] Papa!

844
00:45:19,591 --> 00:45:23,345
-Papa, enough! Papa!
-[gunshots]

845
00:45:23,429 --> 00:45:24,596
[Julio] You animals!

846
00:45:24,680 --> 00:45:26,723
-[gunshots]
-Papa, enough!

847
00:45:26,807 --> 00:45:28,684
Enough! Enough!

848
00:45:29,393 --> 00:45:31,603
Papa! Enough!

849
00:45:31,687 --> 00:45:33,105
Enough!

850
00:45:33,188 --> 00:45:37,109
-[indistinct yelling]
-[dramatic music playing]

851
00:45:37,192 --> 00:45:38,694
[Emilia] Let's go!

852
00:45:38,777 --> 00:45:40,195
[people clamoring]

853
00:45:40,279 --> 00:45:42,489
[people chanting] Down with the Ardientes!

854
00:45:42,573 --> 00:45:44,867
THE ARDIENTES ARE EVIL!

855
00:45:44,950 --> 00:45:50,122
-Down with the Ardientes!
-[loud smashing, breaking]

856
00:45:50,205 --> 00:45:53,542
-Down with the Ardientes!
-[loud smashing, breaking]

857
00:45:53,625 --> 00:46:01,425
-[people clamoring]
-[dramatic music playing]

858
00:46:09,516 --> 00:46:12,686
[Julio] <i>I never thought</i>
<i>it would come to this.</i>

859
00:46:12,769 --> 00:46:14,813
<i>That a single wildflower</i>

860
00:46:14,897 --> 00:46:17,774
<i>would take down a king like me.</i>

861
00:46:17,858 --> 00:46:21,695
[Leandro] <i>Our town's true</i>
<i>and rightful governor,</i>

862
00:46:21,778 --> 00:46:23,530
<i>Diego Torillo!</i>

863
00:46:23,614 --> 00:46:24,948
[crowd] <i>Diego! Diego! Diego!</i>

864
00:46:25,032 --> 00:46:27,826
-[Lily] <i>You are my life, Diego.</i>
-<i>I love you so much.</i>

865
00:46:27,910 --> 00:46:30,204
[Lily] <i>I love you so much too, Diego.</i>

866
00:46:30,287 --> 00:46:33,499
[Diego] <i>We will wipe away</i>
<i>all the filth left in our town.</i>

867
00:46:33,582 --> 00:46:35,542
<i>And together, we will create…</i>

868
00:46:35,626 --> 00:46:37,461
<i>-…a new Poblacion Ardiente!</i>
<i>-Diego! Diego!</i>

869
00:46:38,128 --> 00:46:38,962
[gunshot]

870
00:46:39,046 --> 00:46:42,216
[people clamoring]

871
00:46:42,299 --> 00:46:45,052
[theme music playing]
